        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or 8 (64bit) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz Intel i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10.x or OpenGL 3.3 with video card with 1GB ram and support for v4 shaders<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> May not work properly with Windows 7 and 8 (32bit) version</li></ul>"
